sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Scheduler (daily)
    participant A as Accrual engine
    participant P as Policy service
    participant E as Employee service
    participant L as Ledger

    C->>A: run_time_based_accruals(today)
    loop each policy assignment
        A->>E: hire date, hours per day, termination
        loop each period from assignment start to today
            A->>P: which version was in effect at the period start?
            A->>A: eligible days = period ∩ assignment ∩ employment ∩ waiting period
            A->>A: amount = rate (tenure tier) x hours per day x proration
            A->>A: cap at max balance if the policy has one
            A->>L: post ACCRUAL, key = accrual:alice:vacation:monthly:2026-10-01
            Note over L: key already exists = skip.<br/>So re-runs and catch-up are safe.
        end
    end
